                    <h5><span style="color:#ffffff;">“The Salvation Army has developed a new strategic plan to change our organizational structure and services, allowing us to expand and improve our outreach to thousands of individuals, giving them a truly life-changing pathway to hope.”</span></h5>

<p style="color:#fff">
	<span style="color:#ffffff;">– Bernie DiFiore, Campaign Co-Chair</span>
</p>
