<h5 style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:text:92:39"><span style="color:#ed1c2b;">Get Involved</span></h5>
<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:textarea:93:4">
					The love we have for our community and one another can transform people’s lives and the future of our region. We invite you to join us as part of One&nbsp;Army,&nbsp;Many&nbsp;Fronts as we strive to Do the Most Good.
				</p>
<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:94:17">
					If you're interested in joining the campaign or learning more, please email us below or call us at&nbsp;<a href="tel:2146378131">214-637-8131</a>.
				</p>
